{"Title":"An Act requiring employers to post information on veterans' benefits and services ","BillNumber":"H4021","DocketNumber":"HD4285","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"PLC1","Name":"Peter Capano","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PLC1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-26T11:49:15.38"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"PLC1","Name":"Peter Capano","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PLC1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-26T11:49:15.3933333"},{"Id":"BWM1","Name":"Brian W. Murray","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BWM1","ResponseDate":"2023-06-26T14:51:36.0333333"},{"Id":"BPC0","Name":"Brendan P. Crighton","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BPC0","ResponseDate":"2023-09-28T11:05:11.6333333"},{"Id":"SGX1","Name":"Steven George Xiarhos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SGX1","ResponseDate":"2023-09-28T11:05:11.6333333"},{"Id":"ERP1","Name":"Edward R. Philips","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/ERP1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-02T10:25:23.6066667"},{"Id":"BMA1","Name":"Brian M. Ashe","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BMA1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-02T10:25:23.6066667"},{"Id":"RME1","Name":"Rodney M. Elliott","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RME1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-02T10:25:23.6066667"},{"Id":"JAG1","Name":"Jessica Ann Giannino","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAG1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-02T10:25:23.6066667"},{"Id":"MSV1","Name":"Marcus S. Vaughn","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MSV1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-02T10:25:23.6066667"},{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2023-10-13T11:38:48.84"},{"Id":"P_M1","Name":"Paul McMurtry","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/P_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-13T11:38:48.84"},{"Id":"S_M1","Name":"Samantha Montaño","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-17T12:04:40.7433333"},{"Id":"PRF0","Name":"Paul R. Feeney","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PRF0","ResponseDate":"2023-10-17T14:34:14.3033333"},{"Id":"WFM1","Name":"William F. MacGregor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WFM1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-25T10:04:39.5833333"},{"Id":"KGH1","Name":"Kevin G. Honan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KGH1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-09T15:01:53.0033333"},{"Id":"T_V1","Name":"Tommy Vitolo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_V1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-13T10:20:18.5566667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4021/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Capano of Lynn, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Peter Capano that the Secretary of Veterans' Services be authorized to create a veterans' benefits and services notice and that certain employers be required to post said notice.  Veterans and Federal Affairs.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Chapter 115 of the General Laws is hereby amended by inserting after section 2D the following section:-  \r\n\tSection 2E. (a) The secretary, in consultation with the executive office of labor and workforce development, shall create and distribute a veterans' benefits and services notice.  \r\n\t(b) The veterans’ benefits and services poster shall include information regarding the services and resources available to veterans, including: (i) contact and website information for the executive office of veterans' services and the department of veterans' services; (ii) information about substance abuse and mental health treatment resources; (iii) educational, workforce and training resources; (iv) resources for tax benefits information; (v) information about obtaining a veteran’s indicator on a state driver’s license or identification card; (vi) information about eligibility for unemployment insurance benefits under state or federal law; (vii) legal services resources; and (viii) contact information for the United States Department of Veterans Affairs Veterans Crisis Line. \r\n\t(c) Every employer in the commonwealth with more than 50 full-time employees shall post the notice created pursuant to this section in a conspicuous place accessible to employees in the workplace. \r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect 90 days following its passage. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}